    "explanation": "Purpose-specific tools turn a hidden mode decision into a visible selection decision — the thing tool descriptions are good at guiding. Each tool's contract is explicit, and misrouting drops accordingly.   Why not the others: A buries the selection problem one layer deeper; B improves documentation of a structure that remains ambiguous; C reduces options while keeping the overloaded design.",
