    "explanation": "Setting `\"is_error\": true` on the `tool_result` block is the documented mechanism for communicating tool failures to the model. The model can then reason about the error — retrying with different parameters, choosing an alternative tool, or informing the user — rather than proceeding with incomplete information.",
