    "id": "C-q-1.3-easy-3",
    "scenario": "An engineering team is adopting multi-agent patterns. A senior engineer states: 'We should give each subagent only the tools it absolutely needs for its specific subtask.' A junior engineer asks why this matters if all subagents are trusted internal components.",
