    "scenario": "A research assistant workflow has a `web_search` step followed by a `synthesise_findings` step. The architect wants the synthesis prompt to include the exact URLs returned by the search so the model can cite sources. Currently, the workflow passes only the search query string as context to the synthesis step.",
