    "explanation": "Persisting the structured output of `web_search` in the workflow state and explicitly injecting it into the next step's context is the canonical structured handoff pattern. It ensures the synthesis step receives exactly the data it needs (URLs and snippets) without relying on the model's memory, re-execution, or external lookups.",
