    "scenario": "A developer is reviewing two candidate error messages for an MCP tool that searches a user directory. The tool returns an error when no users match the search criteria. Option X: `\"No users found matching query: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email LIKE '%@example.com' AND role='admin'\"`. Option Y: `\"No users found matching the search criteria. Try broadening your search filters.\"`",
