    "explanation": "The coordinator only needs routing capability, so it receives only the delegation tools. Each subagent receives exactly the tools required for its specialized domain and nothing more. This is the textbook application of least privilege: no agent has access to tools it does not need, minimizing the blast radius of any compromise or misbehavior.",
