    "scenario": "A team is migrating a monolithic agent (24 tools, frequent wrong-tool selections) to a hierarchical multi-agent architecture. The new design must preserve all 24 capabilities while fixing tool selection reliability. The team proposes two alternatives: Alternative X groups tools into 4 domain-specific subagents of 6 tools each, with a coordinator that routes via 4 delegation tools. Alternative Y creates 24 single-tool subagents, with a coordinator that routes via 24 delegation tools.",
