    "scenario": "A DevOps engineer is configuring a .mcp.json file for a local development environment. The MCP server is a Node.js script that reads a GitHub token from the environment. The engineer wants to launch the server as a child process managed by Claude Code.",
    "domain": "Tool Design & MCP Integration",
