    "scenario": "A developer writes the following slash command file:\n\n```markdown\n---\nallowed-tools: [Bash]\nargument-hint: \"<ticket-number>\"\n---\nFetch the Jira ticket $ARGUMENTS and summarize the acceptance criteria.\n```\n\nA colleague reviews it and notes that the command will fail silently if invoked without an argument.",
