    "id": "C-q-3.6-hard-2",
    "scenario": "A CI pipeline generates tests with Claude Code and immediately runs them. In production, the pipeline started failing intermittently: sometimes Claude Code returns syntactically valid JSON but the `testCode` field contains Python syntax errors that cause the test runner to crash. The team wants to make the pipeline self-healing without adding manual review gates.",
