    "id": "C-q-4.2-medium-3",
    "scenario": "A prompt engineer is building a code-review assistant. She writes four few-shot examples where all reviewed code snippets are correct and the expected output is always 'LGTM — no issues found.' She then deploys the assistant and discovers it almost never flags real bugs.",
