    "scenario": "A healthcare analytics company processes de-identified patient discharge summaries to extract structured clinical codes. They have 30,000 summaries ready each morning and need final coded results by 5 PM the same day. Their current synchronous pipeline fails intermittently under load, and the team wants to redesign it using the Message Batches API. A strict requirement is that every summary must be traceable to its coded result for HIPAA compliance purposes.",
