      "A": "Store the full patient summary content inside the `custom_id` field for direct traceability",
      "B": "Assign each summary a pseudonymous internal document ID as the `custom_id`; maintain a separate secure mapping table linking document IDs to patient records outside the API payload",
      "C": "Use sequential integers as `custom_id` values and rely on submission order to reconstruct the mapping after results are returned",
