    "explanation": "Customer preference tracking is specifically intended to personalize escalation behavior. When a customer has documented a preference for self-service, the agent should honor that by attempting additional resolution steps — such as retrieving supplementary information or rephrasing the answer — before triggering escalation. The threshold is a guide, not an absolute override of documented customer preferences.",
