    "id": "C-q-5.4-hard-2",
    "scenario": "During a long exploration session, an agent used /compact and then realized that a critical architectural insight about a circular dependency — discovered 2 hours earlier — was lost in the compaction summary. The insight had not been written to any scratchpad file because the agent was mid-analysis when /compact was run.",
