    "explanation": "The failure mode here is relying on /compact to preserve in-progress findings. /compact is a lossy compression — it preserves semantic summaries, not complete analytical details. The correct discipline is to externalize findings to scratchpad files eagerly and continuously, treating the context window as volatile working memory and files as durable storage. This way, /compact can run safely at any time without risk of information loss.",
