    "id": "C-q-5.5-medium-1",
    "scenario": "A pipeline processes three document types: invoices (60% of volume, 94% model accuracy), contracts (30% of volume, 78% accuracy), and purchase orders (10% of volume, 88% accuracy). The team has a fixed weekly budget of 500 manual reviews. They want to allocate review effort to maximise error detection.",
