    "question": "A `/migration` skill accepts a name via `$ARGUMENTS`. Three issues: (1) devs invoke without arguments → poorly-named files, (2) it incorporates schema details from unrelated earlier conversations, (3) a dev triggered destructive cleanup due to broad tool access. Which configuration addresses all three?",
