    "question": "Distinct areas have different conventions (React functional+hooks, API async/await, DB repository pattern). Test files are spread alongside code (Button.test.tsx next to Button.tsx), and you want all tests to follow the same conventions regardless of location. Most maintainable way to apply correct conventions automatically?",
